      "text": "Covers three alpha-synuclein-directed small molecules: buntanetap (a translation inhibitor), minzasolmin (a misfolding inhibitor) and anle138b (an oligomer modulator). Buntanetap's Phase 3 early-PD study did not meet its primary endpoint per the paper and Alzforum; its cognition findings are post hoc. UCB announced that ORCHESTRA did not meet primary or secondary endpoints and began ending the minzasolmin extension. Anle138b has reported phase 1 safety data, with efficacy trials described as planned.",
